# Environment for the ADMIN Resume Matcher instance (one per whitelisted email).
# Copy to resume-matcher.admin.env (git-ignored) on the VPS.
#
# This one gets a real key: it is your own instance, on a named volume, behind sign-in.

# MANDATORY since the 2026-09 builds: an empty TENANT_MODE aborts startup, and `single`
# answers 404 to every /api/ request that carries the broker's identity headers — which is
# all of them. See the anon file for the full reasoning; the secret is per instance, so
# generate a separate one here with `openssl rand -hex 32`.
TENANT_MODE=header
GATEWAY_SECRET=replace-me-openssl-rand-hex-32

LLM_PROVIDER=
LLM_MODEL=
LLM_API_KEY=
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
